Version: 8.0
License: BSD
License File: files\LICENSE

Description:
This is version 8.0 of the PCRE regular expression matching library from
http://www.pcre.org/

Local Modifications:
Hand-massaged the following header files from their corresponding .in files
to allow PCRE to compile with the desired options:

config.h
pcrecpparg.h
pcre_stringpiece.h
pcre_stringpiece.h

pcrecpp.cc: the always-failing assert in NewlineMode's else branch was written
'assert(NULL == "message")', which MSVC flags as C4130 -- a comparison against
the address of a string constant. Rewritten as 'assert(false && "message")',
the usual spelling of the same idiom. The assertion still always fires and
still prints the message; nothing else changes.
